# <%= bundle[:label] %> bundle

<%= bundle[:blurb] %>

<% if shared_fonts.any? -%>
This zip contains every font file required by the **<%= bundle[:label] %>** bundle of the
[TRMNL Framework](https://trmnl.com), together with the **Inter Variable** typeface
used on high-density displays. Activate the bundle in your markup by adding
`<%= bundle[:class_name] %>` to the screen root.
<% else -%>
This zip contains the pixel fonts of the **<%= bundle[:label] %>** bundle of the
[TRMNL Framework](https://trmnl.com), and nothing else. The full bundle download adds
the **Inter Variable** typeface used on high-density displays. Activate the bundle in
your markup by adding `<%= bundle[:class_name] %>` to the screen root.
<% end -%>

Released on <%= released_at.iso8601 %>.

## Pixel fonts

<% bundle[:fonts].each do |font| %>
### <%= font[:family] %>

<%= font[:desc] %>

- **Designed at:** <%= font[:size] %> pixel height
- **Weights:** <%= font[:weights].join(', ') %>
- **Formats:** <%= font[:formats].join(', ') %>
- **Designer:** <%= font[:designer] %><%= font[:designer_url] ? ", <#{font[:designer_url]}>" : '' %>
<% if font[:license].present? -%>
- **License:** <%= font[:license] %><%= font[:license_url] ? ", <#{font[:license_url]}>" : '' %>
<% end -%>
<% if font[:copyright].present? -%>
- **Copyright:** <%= font[:copyright] %>
<% end -%>
<% if font[:source_url].present? -%>
- **Source:** <<%= font[:source_url] %>>
<% end -%>

Files included:
<% font[:files].each do |file| %>
- `<%= file %>`
<% end %>

<% end %>

<% if shared_fonts.any? -%>
